##Lessons Learnt
- That highly descriptive prompts describing a product don't necessarily produce more accurate outputs. That when using image-to-image generation, the prompt should describe the scene and defer to the image for product accuracy.
- By splitting each responsiblity between different agents produced deeper and more accurate outputs than a single combined prompt would have.
- Testing with real data caught product accuracy issues and other errors that never would have been caught reading code alone.

